'''Skull Rider Vars''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]]. A Halloween variant of [[Vars (Uber Rare Cat)|Vars]], he can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Halloween Capsules (Gacha Event)|Halloween Capsules]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]] gives his knockback and slow abilities a 100% chance to activate.

{{Cat Info
