}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Nightmare King Vars''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Halloween Knight Vars''' level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal/Evolved Form'''===
Skull Rider Vars targets Aliens and Zombies. His matchup against Aliens is somewhat questionable, as while he can destroy their barriers to inflict status effects, he can sometimes cause your melee units to inadvertently advance within range of backliners like [[Elder Sloth]] and Spacefish Jones, though he has no trouble against melee aliens in general. Against Zombies, Skull Rider Vars does it much better, as many zombies tend to have very low range, and his knockback effect can stop them from [[Burrow|burrowing]] while his Zombie Killer ability allows him to finish them off. His stats are also decent enough to absorb a couple of hits, but keep in mind his knockback can also push zombies that survive his attack into your other units.

==='''True Form'''===
Halloween Knight Vars now has a 100% chance to slow/knockback Alien and Zombie enemies, which significantly improves his consistency by giving your other units much bigger windows of opportunity. Although backliners tend to pose a threat from time to time, this tends be a minor issue. The True Form's low cost and benefits far outweigh its only notable drawback, making it a worthy addition.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner & Crowd-Controller}}

